WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.504
Ekagajpatra helps you understand government processes
and generate required documents in minutes.

2
00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:09.909
To begin, register or log in using your phone number.

3
00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:15.314
After logging in, choose the document or service you
need from the available templates.

4
00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:21.620
Each service is organized by task block, so you can
see the related documents in one place.

5
00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:27.025
For example, company update documents are grouped
together for easy access.

6
00:00:27.025 --> 00:00:32.430
You can also watch the guidance video to understand
the process before generating the document.

7
00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:36.934
Once you select a document, complete the payment to
continue.

8
00:00:36.934 --> 00:00:43.240
Now fill in the required company information in the
form.

9
00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:49.546
Enter the company name, address, shareholder name, and
other required details.

10
00:00:49.546 --> 00:00:57.653
Ekagajpatra provides legal provisions, practical
process guidance, document drafting, and do's and
don'ts.

11
00:00:57.653 --> 00:01:03.959
These guides help users understand what to prepare and
what mistakes to avoid.

12
00:01:03.959 --> 00:01:10.265
The platform connects Nepali citizens, Ekagajpatra,
and government documentation processes.

13
00:01:10.265 --> 00:01:16.571
Continue filling in the input fields carefully
according to the requested information.

14
00:01:16.571 --> 00:01:24.678
You can select categories, enter notes, and choose the
correct options from the drop-down menus.

15
00:01:24.678 --> 00:01:31.885
Make sure all spelling, company details, and dates are
correct before generating the document.

16
00:01:31.885 --> 00:01:39.092
After entering the information, click the next or
preview button.

17
00:01:39.092 --> 00:01:46.298
The system will generate a preview of your document.

18
00:01:46.298 --> 00:01:53.505
Review the generated document carefully before
downloading or submitting it.

19
00:01:53.505 --> 00:02:01.613
The highlighted sections show where your entered
information has been placed in the final document.

20
00:02:01.613 --> 00:02:07.918
You can go back and edit the information if anything
needs correction.

21
00:02:07.918 --> 00:02:16.026
After confirmation, generate the final document.

22
00:02:16.026 --> 00:02:23.233
The generated documents are saved in your dashboard.

23
00:02:23.233 --> 00:02:29.539
From the dashboard, you can view and download your
documents whenever needed.

24
00:02:29.539 --> 00:02:36.745
You will also receive payment and document information
through email.

25
00:02:36.745 --> 00:02:42.150
Ekagajpatra makes government documentation easier for
Nepali citizens.

26
00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:47.555
Thank you.
